      "id": "p0179-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "However, this Final Fantasy quote is famous because of its odd translation - the original Japanese line was normal and unremarkable. For this reason, the Final Fantasy reference is less recognizable in Japanese than in English.",
